## Overview

We propose the **Stable Accelerated Adaptive Diffusion (SADA)** method, introducing a **dual pruning approach**—step-wise pruning (skipping) and token-wise pruning—to accelerate diffusion models while maintaining stability.

This work is currently under submission to ICML, and I am a **co-first author**. My contributions include the **development of the approximation framework, step selection criteria, and all theoretical formulations and proofs**. Additionally, I contributed to the **writing** of the paper. 

More details will be shared once the review process is complete.
